  ('ps-hardknott-pass-summit-pull-in', 'photo', 'Hardknott Pass summit pull-in', 'Small parking area at the top of Hardknott Pass, one of England''s steepest roads. Bike magazine and rider write-ups describe stopping for the view from the summit towards Wrynose.', private.pt(54.4029, -3.1849), null, null, null, 'Cumbria', array['Roadside: park fully off the road.', 'Gradients up to 1 in 3 with hairpins; not for nervous riders or low cars.', 'Often closed or icy in winter.', 'Tiny pull-in: do not block the road.', 'Medium confidence: the position or details are not confirmed for 2026 (research notes).']::text[]),
  ('ps-brotherswater-inn-car-park-kirkstone-north', 'photo', 'Brotherswater Inn car park (Kirkstone north)', 'Inn by Brothers Water at the foot of the Kirkstone Pass on the A592. A Wemoto motorcycle ride report recommends it as a scenery stop with a good car park.', private.pt(54.4986, -2.9227), null, null, null, 'Cumbria', array['Private car park: be respectful; security may move you on.', 'Private pub car park; for customers.', 'Medium confidence: the position or details are not confirmed for 2026 (research notes).']::text[]),
  ('ps-broughton-in-furness-market-square', 'photo', 'Broughton-in-Furness market square', 'Village square that a Wemoto motorcycle ride report calls a popular halt for riders, who park up in the square by the cafes.', private.pt(54.2767, -3.2122), null, null, null, 'Cumbria', array['Roadside: park fully off the road.', 'Small village square; respect residents.', 'Medium confidence: the position or details are not confirmed for 2026 (research notes).']::text[]),
  ('ps-majuba-car-park-redcar-seafront', 'photo', 'Majuba car park, Redcar seafront', 'Large seafront car park at Coatham, Redcar. It is a long-running car cruising spot covered by a council vehicle-nuisance PSPO, and in 2026 the council trialled closing it at night to stop illegal car racing.', private.pt(54.6196, -1.0812), null, null, null, 'North Yorkshire (Redcar and Cleveland)', array['Vehicle-nuisance PSPO bans car cruising gatherings here: https://redcar-cleveland.gov.uk/community-safety/neighbourhood-services/public-space-protection-orders-pspos/vehicle-nuisance-pspo.', 'Night closure (10pm-6am) trialled in 2026; check if still in force.']::text[]),
  ('ps-teesside-park-showcase-cinema-car-park', 'photo', 'Teesside Park (Showcase Cinema car park)', 'Retail and leisure park car park by the A66. The Showcase Cinema car park has drawn modified-car drivers for years, and police have towed and seized cars there.', private.pt(54.5609, -1.2727), null, null, null, 'North Yorkshire (Stockton-on-Tees)', array['Private car park: be respectful; security may move you on.']::text[]),
  ('ps-st-marys-island-car-park-whitley-bay', 'photo', 'St Mary''s Island car park, Whitley Bay', 'Coastal car park by St Mary''s Lighthouse. Northumbria Police named St Mary''s Lighthouse and the A193 Links Road as car meet trouble spots.', private.pt(55.0688, -1.4527), null, null, null, 'Tyne and Wear', array['Pay parking; council CCTV control room reports speeding to police.', 'Anti-social behaviour taskforce patrols the car parks.']::text[]),
