  ('ps-rochester-relish-a68-last-cafe-in-england', 'photo', 'Rochester Relish, A68 (Last Cafe in England)', 'Roadside cafe on the A68 at Rochester, recommended by riders as a pit stop on the scenic A68 route to Scotland.', private.pt(55.2768, -2.2699), null, null, null, 'Northumberland', array['Private car park: be respectful; security may move you on.', 'Military ranges nearby; stay on the public road.', 'Medium confidence: the position or details are not confirmed for 2026 (research notes).']::text[]),
