  ('ps-aberdeen-beach-esplanade-car-parks', 'photo', 'Aberdeen Beach Esplanade car parks', 'Seafront parking along the Beach Esplanade by the Beach Ballroom. Aberdeen beach is the city''s best-known unofficial car meet spot, with repeated large meets reported by police and press.', private.pt(57.1553, -2.0808), null, null, null, 'Aberdeen City', array['Heavy police attention on unofficial meets; arrests, seizures and fixed penalties reported.', 'Busy on sunny days and summer evenings.']::text[]),
